# (github.com/rexglue/rexglue-sdk, BSD-3-Clause): SDL_EVENT_QUIT (SDL turns SIGINT/SIGTERM into it) goes through the
# normal window close path (ProcessQuitRequest), also synchronously from an event watch. Its Cocoa parts left out.
# Plus espgaluda2-recomp's own: the UI loop checks the Wayland socket for a hang-up twice a second (lost compositor).
